  <metadata>
    <name>D15 Andenes → Senja → Tromsø</name>
    <desc>135 km road, ≈3.0 h riding. Senja National Tourist Route (Fv86/Fv862) – narrow with blind bends, use the M passing places. Fill up before Senja – fuel is scarce on the outer coast.</desc>
  </metadata>
